      "author_association": "MEMBER",
      "body": "It looks like we don't use links in macro visibilities:\r\n\r\n```rust\r\n#![feature(decl_macro)]\r\n\r\npub mod inner1 {\r\n    pub mod inner2 {\r\n        pub mod inner3 {\r\n            pub(in crate::inner1) macro foo() {}\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/37223377/110180131-1553be00-7dbe-11eb-8191-229c7a6b3059.png)\r\n\r\n@jyn514 thinks this might be a bug.\r\n\r\n_Originally posted by @camelid in https://github.com/rust-lang/rust/pull/82815#discussion_r588757825_",
